{"id":973,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p><br></p><p>2025年12月23日下午，“百城千校万企”民企高校促就业冬季行动——百强民企进校园（中北大学）专场活动在本校17号教学楼17205教室顺利举办。本次活动由省工商联与中北大学联合主办，中北大学机械工程学院、计算机科学与技术学院、电气与控制工程学院联合承办。省工商联社会服务部部长刘利军担任主持，省工商联党组成员、副主席李剑英，中北大学招生与就业工作部部长李博，山西省信息技术产业协会会长张小冬及百信信息集团等百强民企代表，与中北大学2026届毕业生代表共同参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onlUuDLRLsMz-8MU8WVnll4UzNaLzlnbMNn2oRQ7oR6VMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDMSh7n1yYLl74n7VVLl74Ul-iM4UZnNLbMmL8UzMVnzrFnRNZo7CPLNWFLz-DMRLJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PLky4LzliMYbw62S8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/965DF21A3DAE1A3AB5748FC9634A3EE5/D988F12B/12643\" vheight=\"253.6699981689453\" vwidth=\"337.20001220703125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onlUuDLRLsMz-8MU8WVnll4UzNaLzlnbMNn2oRQ7oR6VMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyDMSh7n1yYLl74n7VVLl74Ul-iM4UZnNLbMmL8UzMVnzrFnRNZo7CPLNWFLz-DMRLJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PLky4LzliMYbw62S8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oU8Mu7UzMfUzVRMU7VfL4vsLllZL7nnfLmNanm9aU8LZMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfoSyYMYyYU4L8nzW7nzlbLl-iLmvDLznkUzCio7Ubnz6FL8CDUm7bLRfFLzGaLR-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PLky4LzliMYbw62S8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1A9272C34E2DE591B527614BA658D9E7/3F6B1900/10002\" vheight=\"253.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"337.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oU8Mu7UzMfUzVRMU7VfL4vsLllZL7nnfLmNanm9aU8LZMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0LShfoSyYMYyYU4L8nzW7nzlbLl-iLmvDLznkUzCio7Ubnz6FL8CDUm7bLRfFLzGaLR-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz9PLky4LzliMYbw62S8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p>活动按照议程顺利推进，李博部长首先致辞，随后介绍了学校人才培养模式、专业优势及毕业生特点。百信信息集团、山西晋南钢铁集团等多家企业代表依次宣讲人才需求、招聘计划与培养举措，展现了民营企业的用人诚意与发展机遇。李剑英副主席在讲话中强调了民营企业吸纳就业的重要作用，寄语学子把握机遇、扎根民企成长。活动最后，企业与学院负责人、毕业生展开面对面对接交流，现场互动氛围热烈。</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on7UuPM8WVoRQ2MU7MkL4l8MNQ2U8LnsMRQRL4ARLmVfLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybMkhVnky8o77YMlnRMmVRnm7DnzT7LmW7LlLDMmffUzMFMmUDLmn2oznFnRvan1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPMzlsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/394ED48A25DC61CF16E9D22D1C660AA3/64624F94/D70F\" vheight=\"253.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"337.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=on7UuPM8WVoRQ2MU7MkL4l8MNQ2U8LnsMRQRL4ARLmVfLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybMkhVnky8o77YMlnRMmVRnm7DnzT7LmW7LlLDMmffUzMFMmUDLmn2oznFnRvan1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPMzlsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ooz9uiozfkM4CZUU8UDoRlDnNUbU4fn7U4MVLNlYMllbU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybnkh2M1yaM7CinmGZUz67nmQRnNCioznfnln7M7nRUlQFnRNYM4vaL4VFozLbM1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPMzlsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/29DF604F5F08A7DF6CFF594AEDD4DCAF/D9277031/9396\" vheight=\"253.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"337.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ooz9uiozfkM4CZUU8UDoRlDnNUbU4fn7U4MVLNlYMllbU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ybnkh2M1yaM7CinmGZUz67nmQRnNCioznfnln7M7nRUlQFnRNYM4vaL4VFozLbM1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPMzlsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p>此次专场活动以精准化校企对接为核心，不仅为中北大学毕业生拓宽了就业渠道，也为山西民营企业输送优质人才搭建了平台，助力山西省高校毕业生高质量充分就业与民营经济高质量发展。</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL4CusnRUDUznRLUzCbo7LDL8lanR9naMmr7L4rkUmCinRU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7UYyaUYysUz6RM8MfLR74UmlsL46fnN-sM4CPLmN8LzTFUll4nl7bLzTFoz6RLYb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPoR7ag4LPMzlsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1810&nid=31557&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DDC0C7A7C7CA013B5737AFB776129419/AE3EA919/97C3\" vheight=\"253.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"337.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL4CusnRUDUznRLUz